# Patterns to ignore when building packages.
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
# NOT *.tgz — Helm's chart loader applies .helmignore when LOADING a chart
# for install/upgrade/template, not just when packaging one. This chart
# vendors its dependencies (postgresql/agent-brain/mcp-hub) as .tgz files
# under charts/ via `helm dependency update` — a blanket *.tgz pattern here
# silently excludes those from the loaded chart, which is exactly what
# produced "found in Chart.yaml, but missing in charts/ directory" even
# though dependency update had just written them to disk successfully.
